message: "If you use the NEXUS ontology or the examples in this repository, please cite the associated NEXUS research manuscript and acknowledge the ontology project."

title: "NEXUS: Neurodegenerative Disease Knowledge Ontology"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Taheri Moghadam"
    given-names: "Sharare"
    affiliation: "Iran University of Medical Sciences"
  - family-names: "Jabin"
    given-names: "Md Shafiqur Rahman"
    email: "mdshafiqur.rahmanjabin@lnu.se"
    affiliation: "Linnaeus University"

abstract: >
  NEXUS is an integrated OWL 2 ontology for representing and connecting
  neurodegenerative disease knowledge across clinical, cognitive, biological,
  anatomical, diagnostic, therapeutic, temporal, artificial intelligence,
  explainability, clinical decision-support, and patient-safety domains.
  This repository provides selected public-facing ontology representations,
  competency questions, and SPARQL examples associated with the NEXUS project.

repository-code: "https://github.com/SharareTaheriMoghadam/NEXUS-Neurodegenerative-Disease-Ontology"

url: "https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/NEXUS"

